From 7eaa68a12b64d7916a5dfee433484f861fc765ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ilya84 <kacnep.0000@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 19:32:33 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] los-tv: initrd on Bliss-Bass 8c6a69f: BCB recovery, mode
 markers, /metadata, MODE reset, NIC firmware

Port of the los-tv initrd patches to Bliss-Bass upstream:
- recovery by BCB from misc.img; GRUB mode markers cleanup; NIC modules
  for recovery; persistent kmsg log on the ESP (UUID from fstab.android);
- /metadata on the cdrom partition (persistent aconfig overrides and
  APEX rollback data), fallback to tmpfs; MODE=normal reset after GRUB;
- rtl_nic firmware and NIC kernel modules restored (the 20260905 release
  initrd_lib ships only busybox/ntfs-3g, so recovery had no network);
- Android.mk keeps the 16 MiB initrd padding and drops HFS+/APM from the ISO.
